      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Unlike most tools on the site, which remember the user's last input in localStorage, the JWT decoder deliberately never saves the token anywhere (not even locally) because a decoded JWT can contain sensitive claims; the same policy is applied independently to the password generator's output and the hash generator's input text."
